<title>USA: BHC Communications Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>BHC Communications Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.06   profit	 $0.73</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,444   profit	17,825</p>
<p> Revs		     107,125		  111,551</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,957		   24,530</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.22   profit	 $1.20</p>
<p> Net profit		 5,303   profit	29,469</p>
<p> Revs		     329,090		  336,979</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,057		   24,597</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 periods include state income tax reversal of $20 million.</p>
<p>Q3 losses in United Paramount Network: $38.9 million vs $28.7 million.</p>
<p>Nine month losses in United Paramount Network: $106.7 million vs $95.8 million.</p>
<p>Decline in average common shares outstanding reflects purchases by BHC of its Class A Common Shares. SOURCE  BHC Communications, Inc.</p>
